Fixing the boots isn't too important - it only gives 1 point of AC.
Blessed enchant armour will fetch up to 3 points.  But yes, find a
better helmet and gloves.

If you're invisible, you might want to swap displacement for something
else, since it will only effect enemies who see invisible.
Displacement is fun though.

Two weapon means no life saving, which you might like to wear.  It
will save you from certain accidents, but I find it not that useful;
if I get pounded to death, chances are I'll just get pounded to death
again.  Your choice.  Vlad has an amulet if you're interested.

